{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:23:300","content":{"id":300,"title":"建议","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7d1c82a3-3f1c-4028-80cd-d935c4299ed3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关于信息源的建议："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"2fc9dd74-0285-40b5-bd93-0077ea3fc2fb","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"49a69ba5-54f1-401f-80bd-1b2320a16e99","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"539e1622-00e2-425b-becc-e6bf9687ec81","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"做减法，削减信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"21d1f848-b506-4752-b139-e650e69733a2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们现在缺的不是信息，而是高质量的信息，我们的注意力有限，不要被低质量的信息浪费了时间，因此要削减这部分的信息源"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"beccb530-ee5c-4007-93bb-53106b067934","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b1ce60de-594d-4c62-8128-996716f2a718","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a1cd1a2d-0c62-4185-8c61-8792c60da4da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"削减利用情绪的信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"49f5a032-6073-4083-8ab8-51956a669ff5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"标题党，引发焦虑，带动情绪，扰乱正常规划和做事节奏"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"31b45700-dee8-4ab6-8cdf-1d6bf6109fe9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5c8743d1-7572-4b15-a410-60205847937f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"削减觉得舒适的信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3a16052e-e455-413e-8aa3-72d23a850626","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"让人舒适的原因是什么，是因为观点和我们的看法相当一致，无法触发新的思考和改变了，此类信息源作用不大了"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ef3a828d-4e40-4ba8-b0c5-7d7674d38141","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5027bd5a-4abf-4371-a18a-a201786dd3e3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"削减缺乏事实依据的信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"54bb4f51-2b9e-46eb-a8b4-2bfe5d3abf45","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"信息中充满了大量的观点，暴论，但是缺乏事实依据，缺乏数据支撑，不可靠"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"93201f71-805f-4136-b563-a95b470e3f81","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"43955dd6-bee8-40ce-8b92-951054a46ad6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"做加法，增加书本之外的信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ac8d1fb5-1570-4ed3-a8e3-cede691a329f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们获取高质量信息源的方式，最快的方式就是从书本、论文获取，但不可作为唯一的获取信息源的方式，书也有一些问题，从写作到出版，最少一年，对于一些日新月异的领域来说，太晚了，另外有一些是书中不会提的，需要在实践中总结的"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"a2711b91-9d4b-4165-b95f-ccf95b5b17c1","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"140c360d-1ee2-4583-8122-86c88776c1c9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"30bd4c12-64c9-47e7-a3f5-a956318333b0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"他人作为信息源"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2825eec7-4f57-4180-9493-e4efc54da677","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从真正的实践者获取信息，多请教多观察，注意以下三点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"b00e4a2f-d4d3-4d67-9ce0-475480692247","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1324574d-a7d9-4146-bb25-03c16952a51e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"51503ab9-dee4-4ecd-aba7-1732f7bf5bc7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关注细节，真正的实践者不会阐述宏大叙事，而是细节间的微妙联系"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"76487ceb-7ccd-4b46-9d58-39c942e109b8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f6a9645a-838e-4191-a6f5-341832a39bfe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关注失败，有的时候成功是天时地利人和，很难复制，但是失败都是有具体原因的，要吸取这些经验，少走弯路"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5dda5b85-d066-4f6e-be8a-c72bb053d670","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e240e833-7d60-4840-9c41-291ae364cd59","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"关注一手信息源，别看二手解读的文章，直接去看他人的演讲，文章，博客，报告"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"bbc95158-0c77-4a51-8af8-76a541b54a0c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f1f6e44d-28d5-4d81-b2fc-b375c0d40b41","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"亲自下场"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"31d140fc-7905-4b2c-9ccd-07d6f8c33d96","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"亲自去观察，去调研，去总结经验，投入时间、投入精力，有的时候觉得自己准备充足了，但是下场才知道不了解的问题层出不穷，一定要亲身经历才有深刻感悟"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c47ae00c-3765-4980-b313-86d959b677e1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c9d443ef-6ba4-4a8b-896d-87a58c0851f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"做乘法，多个角度考察信息"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"1f18b68d-4fd1-4918-833c-ad91f6783f5a","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4856f913-9f91-4988-b3da-6130b1ab9114","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4f2e1993-5446-4c63-978a-88c2046f6484","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考虑概念"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"46da7adc-ee29-4143-8a50-0ba1df703371","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个信息当我们向下挖，深入到某一个概念时，会发现我们对其一无所知，通过深挖概念我们可以对信息理解更准确"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d6515deb-92d7-4015-b106-3bbe4d58a54e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9f110cb3-ddd2-414c-826a-d3d75e21d6c4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考察范式"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3b762124-e9d5-48a8-b2ad-4dcace0e9410","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"向上抽象看，找到可迁移的范式，别的领域的经验也可以成为本领域的解决方案，警惕范式不是假大空的大话，而是方法和思路"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8625073f-7dfd-46a6-aa9b-465ce0b8786f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"30e5c676-e6d8-4f43-ae75-9e3abe1784fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"顺藤摸瓜"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d93cbba1-a21b-4092-94cb-9281c419e320","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"优质信息源的其他信息相对也是较为优质的，所参考的资料大概率也是优质的，顺藤摸瓜，汲取这些优质的信息源"}]}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"笔记的方法","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:275","type":"doc","id":275}},{"label":"收集篇，如何做筛选，获取高质量信息","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:297","type":"doc","id":297}},{"label":"建议","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:300","type":"doc","id":300}}],"prevPage":{"title":"原则","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:299","type":"doc","id":299}},"nextPage":{"title":"心法篇，以我为主，持续不断","target":{"key":"doc:project:23:301","type":"doc","id":301}},"createTime":1743910291790,"updateTime":1743919295897,"projectId":23},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743919295897}}